+//! - `mean_variance_trend`: Predicted variance from SVR
+//! - `highly_variable`: Boolean mask for selected genes
+//!
+//! ## Parameter Guidelines
+//!
+//! ### Gene Count Selection
+//! - **1000-2000 genes**: Good for initial exploration
